  "name": "Grilled Chicken Salad Sandwich",
  "subtitle": "Creamy chicken salad with cashews and cranberries",
  "description": "A cool chicken salad with crisp celery, crunchy cashews, and sweet dried cranberries layered with lettuce and tomato on toasted bread.",
